    {
      "bbox": [
        118,
        691,
        1543,
        768
      ],
      "category": "Text",
      "text": "WHEREAS, over the past several months, thousands of asylum seekers have been arriving in New York City, from the Southern border, without having any immediate plans for shelter; and",
      "logprob_stats": {
        "bbox": {
          "n_tokens": 19,
          "mean": -0.2911,
          "min": -1.3685
        },
        "category": {
          "n_tokens": 1,
          "mean": -0.0002,
          "min": -0.0002
        },
        "text": {
          "n_tokens": 35,
          "mean": -0.0003,
          "min": -0.0098
        }
      },
      "ink": {
        "ink_px": 15547,
        "area_px": 99484,
        "density": 0.15628,
        "chars": 181,
        "chars_per_1k_ink": 11.64
      }
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        118,
        807,
        1582,
        922
      ],
      "category": "Text",
      "text": "WHEREAS, the City now faces an unprecedented humanitarian crisis that requires it to take extraordinary measures to meet the immediate needs of the asylum seekers while continuing to serve the tens of thousands of people who are currently using the DHS Shelter System; and",
      "logprob_stats": {
        "bbox": {
          "n_tokens": 19,
          "mean": -0.2606,
          "min": -1.3613
        },
        "category": {
          "n_tokens": 1,
          "mean": -0.0,
          "min": -0.0
        },
        "text": {
          "n_tokens": 47,
          "mean": -0.0002,
          "min": -0.0098
        }
      },
      "ink": {
        "ink_px": 23129,
        "area_px": 148580,
        "density": 0.15567,
        "chars": 272,
        "chars_per_1k_ink": 11.76
      }
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        118,
        962,
        1523,
        1036
      ],
      "category": "Text",
      "text": "WHEREAS, additional reasons for requiring the measures continued in this Order are set forth in Emergency Executive Order No. 224, dated October 7, 2022; and",
      "logprob_stats": {
        "bbox": {
          "n_tokens": 20,
          "mean": -0.2244,
          "min": -1.2744
        },
        "category": {
          "n_tokens": 1,
          "mean": -0.0,
          "min": -0.0
        },
        "text": {
          "n_tokens": 39,
          "mean": -0.0065,
          "min": -0.2532
        }
      },
      "ink": {
        "ink_px": 13674,
        "area_px": 96900,
        "density": 0.14111,
        "chars": 157,
        "chars_per_1k_ink": 11.48
      }
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        118,
        1078,
        1576,
        1227
      ],
      "category": "Text",
      "text": "WHEREAS, the emergency conditions related to the arrival of charter buses in the City, containing large numbers of individuals recently arrived in the United States from other nations who were likely to seek emergency shelter and other immediate services, as described in Emergency Executive Order No. 538, dated December 27, 2023, have ceased; and",
      "logprob_stats": {
        "bbox": {
          "n_tokens": 21,
          "mean": -0.231,
          "min": -1.2838
        },
        "category": {
          "n_tokens": 1,
          "mean": -0.0,
          "min": -0.0
        },
        "text": {
          "n_tokens": 72,
          "mean": -0.0,
          "min": -0.0004
        }
      },
      "ink": {
        "ink_px": 28405,
        "area_px": 192508,
        "density": 0.14755,
        "chars": 348,
        "chars_per_1k_ink": 12.25
      }
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        118,
        1271,
        1587,
        1388
      ],
      "category": "Text",
      "text": "WHEREAS, the state of emergency based on the arrival of thousands of individuals and families seeking asylum, first declared in Emergency Executive Order No. 224, dated October 7, 2022, and extended by subsequent orders, remains in effect;",
      "logprob_stats": {
        "bbox": {
          "n_tokens": 21,
          "mean": -0.2415,
          "min": -1.2354
        },
        "category": {
          "n_tokens": 1,
          "mean": -0.0001,
          "min": -0.0001
        },
        "text": {
          "n_tokens": 54,
          "mean": -0.0004,
          "min": -0.0131
        }
      },
      "ink": {
        "ink_px": 19703,
