      "text": "§ 2. I hereby order sections 2, 3, and 4 of Emergency Executive Order No. 538, dated December 27, 2023, relating to the arrival of charter buses transporting passengers likely to seek emergency shelter and other immediate services in New York City, revoked, effective immediately.",
